@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Digidoclocker)

[*] --> Login

state Login
Login : entry / Get User Details
Login : check Citizen Registration / CheckCitizenRegistration()
Login : validate Login Details / ValidateLoginDetails()
Login : [correct details] --> Profile / Successful Login
Login : [incorrect details] --> MultipleAttempts / Multiple Login Attempts

state Profile
Profile : entry / Show User Profile
Profile : update Profile / UpdateUserProfile()
Profile : view Documents / ViewDocuments()
Profile : apply Certificate / ApplyCertificate()
Profile : cancel Certificate / CancelCertificate()
Profile : continue Uploading / ContinueUploading()
Profile : logout / Logout()

state MultipleAttempts
MultipleAttempts : [incorrect details] --> Login / Multiple Login Attempts
MultipleAttempts : [exceeded attempts] --> EndSession / End Session

state Registration
Registration : entry / Get Registration Details
Registration : validate Registration Details / ValidateRegistrationDetails()
Registration : [accepted details] --> SaveUserInfo / Save User Information
Registration : [invalid details] --> EndProcess / End Registration Process

@enduml
